  "question": {
    "text": "If the fourth term in the binomial expansion of <math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msqrt><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></msub><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msup></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>12</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></math> is equal to <math><mn>200</mn><mo>,</mo></math> and <math><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo></math> then the value of <math><mi>x</mi></math> is"
